    "answer": {
      "short": "$64$",
      "worked": "The constant term comes from choosing the constant in every factor.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Constant term}&=1(-2)(4)(-8)\\\\\\text{Constant term}&=64\\end{align*}$$",
